{
  "note": "Scoring backbone for the Earth-data globe. Each indicator has a direction (higher/lower/neutral is better) so the ranking engine can normalize and combine them. Preset targets are weighted objective profiles; the UI also allows custom weights. Labels MUST match the keys in world-indicators.json .values exactly.",
